---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/sections/PageHero.astro';
import Section from '../components/global/Section.astro';
import CardGrid from '../components/sections/CardGrid.astro';
import MediaSplit from '../components/sections/MediaSplit.astro';
import { teamMembers } from '../data/team';
---
<BaseLayout title="The Team" description="Meet the people shown in the current Wayfinders team experience and read their complete public biographies.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="People of Wayfinders" title="Meet the Team" image="/images/banners/fire-circle-9.jpg" />
  <Section width="prose"><div class="story"><p class="type-label">People-centered work</p><h2 class="type-section">The people who make the circle possible.</h2><p>Wayfinders is built through attentive facilitation, shared learning, and a deep belief in the value of connection.</p></div></Section>
  <Section width="wide"><CardGrid>{teamMembers.map((person) => <article class="person"><img src={person.image} alt={`Portrait of ${person.name}`} width="600" height="700" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><div class="summary"><h2 class="type-card">{person.name}</h2>{person.listingRole && <p class="role">{person.listingRole}</p>}<details><summary>{person.biography.length ? 'Read bio' : 'Profile status'}</summary><div class="bio">{person.credentials && <p class="credentials">{person.credentials}</p>}{person.biography.map((paragraph) => <p>{paragraph}</p>)}{!person.biography.length && <p>The Team page currently lists Emily Orr and links to <code>{person.sourceProfile}</code>, but that public profile returns 404. Her role, biography, and current affiliation require an owner decision.</p>}<p class="source-note">Source profile: <a href={`https://www.wayfindersonthehudson.com${person.sourceProfile}`}>{person.sourceProfile}</a></p></div></details></div></article>)}</CardGrid></Section>
  <Section tone="alternate" width="wide"><MediaSplit imagePosition="right" align="start"><div slot="copy" class="story"><p class="type-label">Our Story</p><h2 class="type-section">A collaborative dynamic rooted in nature and care.</h2><p>Gwen (Nature Connection Specialist &amp; Trained Eco-Psychologist) &amp; Leah (School Counselor &amp; Certified Nature Informed Therapist) have been in each others lives for more than fifteen years and have been working together at Wayfinders for the last five! Their synergies are truly magical and together they elevate all things eco, psychology, and mentoring into a collaborative dynamic duo full of intense joyfulness and smarts. They have successfully run programs for all ages, from newborns through elders together. Wayfinders is their platform to harness sunshine and smiles, and manifest social and environmental change.</p><p>The fusion of Gwen's nature connection &amp; Leah's counseling and coaching creates a powerful combination. Additional support is provided by our stellar team of seasoned nature connection mentors and board members.</p></div><img slot="media" src="https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/61532ef9082b334755993cfd/e24fef2d-985f-424f-a81a-00548c58060c/IMG_0468.jpg?format=1200w" alt="A wooded trail for a Wayfinders walk and talk" width="1200" height="900" loading="lazy" /></MediaSplit></Section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.person{overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--color-line);border-radius:var(--radius-card);background:var(--color-surface)}.person>img{width:100%;aspect-ratio:4/4.6;object-fit:cover}.summary{padding:1.25rem}.summary h2,.role{margin:0}.role{margin-top:.35rem;color:var(--color-ink-muted)}details{margin-top:1rem;border-top:1px solid var(--color-line);padding-top:.75rem}summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:750;color:var(--color-forest-dark)}.bio{padding-top:.75rem}.bio p{color:var(--color-ink-muted)}.credentials{font-weight:700}.source-note{font-size:.875rem}.story{max-width:var(--width-prose)}.story h2{margin-top:.75rem}.story p:not(.type-label){color:var(--color-ink-muted);font-size:1.1rem}
</style>
